
en=[
High speed turns are one of the most important tricks
to know. Here, you can see a long straight road (~ 100 Km/h),
followed by a tight turn, to the left.
Let's try to learn how to make a smooth clean turn.
];

en=[
To make a big turn, you must put car's weight on front
wheels. To do so, you just have to brake a few meters
before the turn. An experimented player may only
release accelerator, without braking.
];

en=[
Accelerate up to 115 km/h using the right part 
of the road, brake a bit and turn left.
When your car enters the turn, accelerate again to the finish

It allows you to take the whole turn around 100 km/h !
];

